Package: ehe
Title: Tools for the Buenos Aires Household and Employment Survey
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Ignacio", "Silvani", email = "silvaniignacio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to access, download, and manipulate microdata Household and Employment
    Survey of the Province of Buenos Aires, Argentina (EHE is the Spanish
    acronym for Household and Employment Survey). The package provides
    functions to query the official open data catalog, identify available EHE
    surveys, download and read microdata, work with variable dictionaries and
    labels, and produce weighted univariate and bivariate tabulations using
    the survey expansion factors. It also provides functions to calculate and
    consult labor market rates and indicators, income and inequality
    indicators, and other statistics derived from the EHE.
